  "description": "OnBarcode .NET SSRS Reports GS1 DataBar Barcode Generator is a C# barcode generator library to create GS1 DataBar barcode format in SSRS reports. \nYou can easily generate GS1 DataBar barcodes in the .NET SSRS reports web and Windows applications.\n\n.NET SSRS Reports Barcode library can be used in C#, VB.NET, ASP.NET Core, Framework, MVC, Windows Forms, WPF, console and desktop applications.\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Documents\n* How to Developer Guide : https://www.onbarcode.com/tutorial/csharp-barcode-generation.html\n* Email : support@onbarcode.com",
